 "notes": "Spine: need -> gap -> Al2Ca hypothesis -> LA91 + 0.2Ca -> cast -> extrude -> Al2Ca identity -> alpha-Mg shape change (cast) || beta-Li refinement (extruded), both explained by E2EM-argued nucleation on Al2Ca -> conclusion. No property is measured; spine ends at STR + DSC (PRP j26 argued, off spine). The nucleation mechanism has no direct evidence (no particle-at-grain-centre statistics, single Ca level, no Ca-without-Al control). j21->j22 op is the proposed mm_op read_orientation_relationship (fallback if rejected: match_to_reference); j21 node type feature_assignment fit poor. F4 (extruded BSE/EDS) and F5 (atom configuration) not opened.",
 "migrated_from": "r03/graphs/Journal_of_Magnesium_and_Alloys__j.jma.2013.12.002.json"
}